strong>Looking ahead:</strong> Suntory is applying water science to help protect this resource for future generations.</p>\r\n<a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47610346.373567/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuc3VudG9yeS5jb20vYWJvdXQtdXMvcGFzc2lvbi1mb3Itd2F0ZXIvP2F4aW9zX2FkbGluaz0xJnV0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aC4a3fc641\" target=\"_blank\">See how.</a></p>\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td height=\"10\" style=\"height: 10px; font-size: 0; border-bottom: 10px solid #f5f5f5;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:20px 3.5% 10px;line-height:1.5\">\r\n<span class=\"b k\" style=\"font-size:27px;font-family:'gorditamedium',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px;line-height:1.5\">  2. 🪶 Parting shot: Pelican pose </span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>   <tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr> <tr>\r\n<td class=\"v\" style=\"padding:0 3.5%;line-height:1.75;font-size:17px;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px\"><div align=\"center\"><!--[if mso]><img alt='' src='https://images.axios.com/aDwy59El0kkPVccOa1sHjeBx2dg=/fit-in/1116x1300/2026/09/22/1790101682375.jpeg' style='display:block; margin: 0 auto; max-width:100%;' width='558' /><![endif]--><!--[if !mso]><!--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://images.axios.com/aDwy59El0kkPVccOa1sHjeBx2dg=/fit-in/1116x1300/2026/09/22/1790101682375.jpeg\" style=\"display:block; margin: 0 auto; max-width:100%;\" width=\"100%\"/><!--<![endif]--></div> <div class=\"bodytext\" style=\"font-size:13px; font-family:'Gordita',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#848484; margin-bottom:20px;\">Photo: Gregory Bull/AP</div><p><strong>Yogis stretch at sunset</strong> as pelicans fly overhead at Sunset Cliffs in San Diego.</p></td>\r\n</tr> <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 3.5% 25px\">   <a href=\"https